<td><p><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="4"><font color="#FFFF99">Links Page Available</font></font></p><br></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF">The <a href="links.asp">links</a> page is now available using the link on the right. Its not very exciting but it has lots of, er, links on it.

If you want your site to be included or you know of any good Everquest sites that arent listed please <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net">e-mail me</a> with the site name, URL and a short description.
</font><p></p></font></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Submitted By: <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net">Carramaena</a> on Saturday, March 11, 2000</i><p></p></font></font></td></tr>
<tr><td><img src="images/line6002.gif">

<tr>
<td><p><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="4"><font color="#FFFF99">Thanks to Everyone Who Responded</font></font></p><br></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF">Thanks to everybody who has e-mailed me about working on the site. We've had a great response, far better than I expected :). Unfortunately I cant e-mail everybody who responded but I will be contacting all the people I would like to invite to work on the site in the next day or two.

Thanks also to people who have mailed me with ideas and suggestions and to let me know about things I have left out. I am still interested in hearing anything anybody has to say about the site and what they would like to see on it. In the meantime, please come back and have a look at how the site is coming along and use the forums. I will be posting on the main EQ sites again when Lands of Norrath is ready to be launched.</font><p></p></font></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Submitted By: <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net">Carramaena</a> on Saturday, March 11, 2000</i><p></p></font></font></td></tr>
<tr><td><img src="images/line6002.gif">

<tr>
<td><p><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="4"><font color="#FFFF99">Forums Working</font></font></p><br></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF">Since quite a few people have been visiting the site after reading my posts asking for staff to help out, I just thought I'd mention that the forums are working so feel free to post there. At this stage, comments and suggestions for the site are particularly welcome. You can access the Forum using the <a href="http://pub8.ezboard.com/blandsofnorrath">Discussion Forums</a> link on the right.</font><p></p></font></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Submitted By: <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net">Carramaena</a> on Monday, March 06, 2000</i><p></p></font></font></td></tr>
<tr><td><img src="images/line6002.gif">

<tr>
<td><p><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="4"><font color="#FFFF99">Lands Of Norrath Beta Version</font></font></p><br></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF">Welcome to the Beta Version of Lands of Norrath, a new Everquest Information Site!<br><br>Since it is a 'beta' version of the site, it is far from complete right now but we will be adding new sections and information all the time. By the time the site goes live, we hope to bring you all the EQ information you need in one place. Our aim is to have a site that gives you the info that YOU, the vistor wants to know. Unlike many sites, we will not have a vast amount of user comments. There are plenty of sites that do this already. Instead, the staff here at Lands of Norrath will make it their business to trawl through the massive amount of info available and present you with the stuff that is useful and accurate and make it easy for you to find it quickly.<br><br>To help us with this goal, it would be useful if you could <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net?subject=eq information wanted">e-mail me</a>, telling me what types of information you most often want to find but isnt easily available. This will help us to include as much useful info as possible.<br><br>As well as information about items, quests, spells and npcs, the site will have a news section, forums, guides, journals and stories and much more. Have a look at whats already here, but bear in mind this is still only a fraction of what will be available on the final site.<br><br>If you have any comments/bug reports etc, please <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net?subject=site comments/bugs">e-mail me</a></font><p></p></font></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Submitted By: <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net">Carramaena</a> on Wednesday, March 01, 2000</i><p></p></font></font></td></tr>
<tr><td><img src="images/line6002.gif">

<tr>
<td><p><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="4"><font color="#FFFF99">Staff Wanted!</font></font></p><br></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF">Lands of Norrath is looking for several people to work on the site. There are several positions available, ranging from site co-admin to News Reporters and Guide Writers.<br><br>If you are interested in helping out with this exciting new EQ site, either as a regular member of staff or by writing a guide, story or journal or submitting screenshots then please <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net?subject=LoN staff">e-mail me</a> with some information about yourself, your Everquest experience and how much and what type of work you think you can help out with.<br><br>Please click <a href="staff.asp">here</a> for more information.</font><p></p></font></td></tr>
<tr><p><td><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" color="#660066" size="2"><font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Submitted By: <a href="mailto:louise.hand@virgin.net">Carramaena</a> on Wednesday, March 01, 2000</i><p></p></font></font></td></tr>
